      ],
      "text": "DevContext is documented as a CLI tool that automatically captures and restores AI coding context, scoped to the current repo and branch."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fbf842dffe44b15d17cffbc47f7366525ac0f2acee0dd33a4328829feca369c6",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "7308ec5a514e1a81c5cc30e7a2acf11c41a97e26",
          "git_sha": "5bee22f93d9a98455dcac97956412b2c1f74235b",
          "line_end": 58,
          "line_start": 50,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "iamunbounded/devctx",
          "url": "https://github.com/IAmUnbounded/devctx/blob/7308ec5a514e1a81c5cc30e7a2acf11c41a97e26/README.md#L50-L58"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a4451e7492ee87cac8be2188223ac9f82ff224d163814270d631973cae9fe408"
      ],
      "text": "Core commands are init, save (with a non-interactive --auto mode), resume (generates an AI prompt and copies to clipboard), log, and diff; these are described as working locally with zero dependencies."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6d8eb8e40255aa82143b1aa92145960e88ecccb5a0d3edb9aaa91f283be4f262",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "7308ec5a514e1a81c5cc30e7a2acf11c41a97e26",
          "git_sha": "5bee22f93d9a98455dcac97956412b2c1f74235b",
          "line_end": 66,
          "line_start": 61,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "iamunbounded/devctx",
          "url": "https://github.com/IAmUnbounded/devctx/blob/7308ec5a514e1a81c5cc30e7a2acf11c41a97e26/README.md#L61-L66"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_478e92286495212e74a65f85cbce2a70a8361c3a0652d85133be475a38727c0c"
      ],
      "text": "Team/automation commands include handoff @user, share (committing the .devctx/ folder to git), watch (auto-save on file changes using chokidar), and hook install for a git post-commit hook."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1d54f1e132766987ae5511154d1b8e0b3e90cab68009fa1eaca233e5adc5a8c3",
