        "slc_7960ece43d606c82c7b0cbdf8837bae13fb53cec3274ca92fc4a90c4ede9a6fd"
      ],
      "text": "An MCP server lets AI agents natively read/write context; it is configured via npx -y devctx mcp and exposes tools devctx_save, devctx_resume, devctx_log and the resource devctx://context."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
