        "slc_aa8e0ada8afbcb45469c7b695249dc64dfb38299cd5199e985523909b23b39bd"
      ],
      "text": "Configuration is managed with devctx config set <key> <val> (e.g. aiProvider, watchInterval) and devctx config list."
    },
